          "_name": "features03",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features03\" group=\"Features\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n\t\t<select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"12\">1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"6\" selected>2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\">3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">4</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n\t\t<header>Cards</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" name=\"imageHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"autoSize && !(showButtons==false && showCardSubtitle==false && showCardTitle==false && showText==false)\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Spacing\" name=\"spacing\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showText\" title=\"Text\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButtons\" title=\"Buttons\" checked>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" required>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#0c2c68\" selected>\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#edefeb\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-head mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>Projects</b></h4>\n\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mt-4 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n\t\t\t\tTo add more cards, hover on a card and click 'Add items'\n\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} active\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/nuclearfeat.webp\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>The Nuclear Renaissance: Strategic Role of Nuclear Energy in the Age of Electricity</b><div><br></div><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Co-authored a policy-focused research paper assessing the role of nuclear power in meeting surging electricity demand driven by AI-powered data centers and electrification trends. Analyzed global electricity projections, grid risks, and the limitations of renewable energy in addressing firm power needs. The paper makes a strong case for reviving nuclear power in the U.S. by exploring its low-carbon, high-reliability attributes alongside cost, safety, and regulatory challenges. It evaluates technological advancements like Small Modular Reactors (SMRs) and fusion, and offers strategic policy recommendations to accelerate nuclear deployment and grid modernization.to captivating life</div></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"></h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t20 may, 20 min\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Cij7zC57EvN3F-oxu6L24nJ6Cj3q-jNM/view?usp=sharing\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-warning-outline\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">read more</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/screenshot-2025-04-07-at-7.35.19pm-294x243.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3 mt-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><p><b>Green Hydrogen from Biomass: Life Cycle Assessment of Gasification Pathways</b><br></p><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Collaborated with Sierra Energy to evaluate the environmental performance of green hydrogen production via biomass gasification using the FastOx system. This first-of-its-kind Life Cycle Assessment (LCA) compared agricultural waste and forest residues as feedstocks under ten distinct scenarios—including with and without carbon capture and co-product allocation for slag and avoided open burning. Assessed multiple environmental categories (GWP, eutrophication, ecotoxicity, etc.) using TRACI 2.0 methodology. Sensitivity analysis showed slag utilization and transportation distances had significant influence on emissions.</div><div><br></div><p></p></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"></h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t27 may, 25 min<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Ggd8JOl0dYLqtIx7nVywypulTITlPRmw/view?usp=sharing\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-warning-outline\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">read more</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/rwe-enformer-gruener-ammoniak-viking-energy-gross.webp\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3 mt-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Ammonia’s Role in Hydrogen Transport: Financial Analysis</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Explored ammonia’s potential as a hydrogen carrier, uncovering estimated transportation costs of $6–8/kg for hydrogen via ships at varying distances. Analyzed cost drivers and exhaustively studied green ammonia transportation, revealing current shipping costs of $800–$950 per tonne of NH₃, subject to distance. Projected an optimistic $200–$300 per tonne cost reduction ahead, underscoring the pathway to enhanced affordability.</div><div><br></div></h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t27 may, 25 min<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-white-outline\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "tIsljcLokI",
          "_anchor": "features03-6",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
